{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A work as a MIDI player plays it: every part’s channel messages, each at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its time in the work, in the order they are sent."}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WorkPerformance","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:10IvorExtern15WorkPerformanceV","modules":[{"name":"IvorExtern"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","title":"WorkPerformance","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WorkPerformance"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WorkPerformance","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/UsingIvorExtern"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The times are kept exactly as the work has them — never as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"floating-point seconds — so that events at the same time are ordered as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Event"},{"type":"text","text":" says, never by rounding. Each part has a channel of its own,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"skipping channel 10, which General MIDI keeps for percussion, until there"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are more parts than channels, when they share."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each of a part’s instruments sounds as the realization assigns it — the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"part’s own assignment, else the realization’s default — and plays on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"assignment’s channel, if it names one, or a percussion patch on channel"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"10, or else on the part’s own channel. An instrument the realization"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t assign sounds as "},{"code":"IvorMIDI\/MIDIPatch\/init(instrument:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" has it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Every channel a part uses gets its first patch at the start, so an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instrument change that moves to another channel sends no program change"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"partway through; one that stays on the channel sends one, after a bank"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"select if the patch has a bank, or if the channel’s previous patch had"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one, which is then reset to bank 0 (see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"IvorMIDI\/MIDIPatch\/selectionMessages(on:after:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each note sounds at the velocity of the part’s dynamic level at its","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attack, so a crescendo rises note by note — or, where an importer kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the note’s exact velocity (its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"attackVelocity"},{"type":"text","text":" extra), at that."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pan and expression are per channel, so each channel takes those of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first part that plays on it, and a later part that shares the channel"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sends none. A part sends its pan on every channel it owns at the start,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and again at a pan-map entry or one of its attacks where the pan has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changed, and throughout a glide while a note sounds. An entry’s exact"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"14-bit pan, where an importer kept one, is sent as it is."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A part also sends expression (CC 11) on every channel it owns except","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"percussion, starting at the start, so that a crescendo or diminuendo","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reaches a note already sounding, wherever a held note would otherwise","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"drift audibly from the written level. The expression is relative to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"velocity: a note attacking during one has a higher velocity, so it still","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sounds at the written level. Where an importer kept a file’s exact","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"expression (the ","type":"text"},{"code":"expressionValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" extra of a dynamic-map entry), that is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sent as it is instead. A part in ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/partsWithoutExpression","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — one that","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plays through an output that ignores CC 11 — sends no expression, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its notes keep their plain velocities, so dynamics fall back on velocity"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"alone."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pedals follow pan’s rule: a part sends its pedals on every channel it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owns, percussion included, and a later part sharing a channel sends none,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so a shared channel’s pedals hold every part’s notes on it. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pedal-table entry is sent exactly as stored, in table order, never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampled, so a re-pedal (an Up then a Down at one time) lets the pedal up"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and puts it down again. Muting mutes notes only, so a muted part’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pedals are still sent. Portamento (CC 65) isn’t sent yet: a future"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gliding-notes feature will send it, and decide who owns it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every note says which part it belongs to, so that a mixer can mute one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"part of several sharing a channel. The performance itself sends no channel"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"volume (CC 7), which it leaves to the mixer."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For now a note that glides plays its start key only. Only a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keyboard-pitch, wall-time work can be made into a performance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A performance plays the notes as they stand, and renders nothing itself:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"grace notes, trills, mordents, tremolos and rolls, fermata holds and"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"caesura pauses sound only in a rendered work (see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IvorModel\/Work\/rendered(options:)"},{"text":"). So a caller renders the work","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"first — while it’s still in beat time, where tempo-relative defaults can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"use its tempo map — then converts the rendered work to keyboard pitch and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wall time, and makes the performance from that. A rendered grace note is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a note like any other: it plays on its part’s channel, sounds under"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whatever pedal is down at its own time, has its pan sent before its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attack, and, followed by the same key, is released before that key is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"struck again (see "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Event"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Event"],"anchor":"Structures"},{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/init(work:realization:partsWithoutExpression:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/duration","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/events","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/ownedChannelSets","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/partChannelSets","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/partChannels","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/partsWithoutExpression"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/channelOutputs(forPartOutputs:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Equatable-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern"]]},"references":{"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/init(work:realization:partsWithoutExpression:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"?("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"work"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Work","preciseIdentifier":"s:9IvorModel4WorkV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"realization","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Realization","preciseIdentifier":"s:9IvorModel11RealizationV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"partsWithoutExpression","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">)","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Creates a ","type":"text"},{"code":"WorkPerformance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instance for the provided work, as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provided realization assigns its sounds, or ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if the work isn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in keyboard pitch and wall time.","type":"text"}],"title":"init(work:realization:partsWithoutExpression:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/init(work:realization:partsWithoutExpression:)","url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/init(work:realization:partswithoutexpression:)"},"doc://IvorExtern/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://IvorExtern/s9EscapableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s9EscapableP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Escapable"},"doc://IvorExtern/SQ":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/SQ","title":"Swift.Equatable"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/partsWithoutExpression":{"kind":"symbol","title":"partsWithoutExpression","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/partsWithoutExpression","url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/partswithoutexpression","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"partsWithoutExpression","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The indices, in the work’s order, of the parts that send no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"expression (CC 11), as given when the performance was made."}]},"doc://IvorExtern/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/events":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"events","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Event","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorExtern15WorkPerformanceV5EventV"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"title":"events","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The events, in the order they are sent.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/events","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/events"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/partChannels":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"partChannels"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MIDIChannel","preciseIdentifier":"s:8IvorMIDI11MIDIChannelV"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"title":"partChannels","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The channel each part plays on unless an assignment says otherwise,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the work’s order."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/partchannels","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/partChannels"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/UsingIvorExtern":{"kind":"article","title":"Using IvorExtern","role":"article","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/UsingIvorExtern","url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/usingivorextern","abstract":[{"text":"Read works from external music notation files, write them back out, and turn","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them into MIDI for playback.","type":"text"}]},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern":{"kind":"symbol","title":"IvorExtern","role":"collection","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern","url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An import and export framework for external music notation formats."}]},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/partChannelSets":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"partChannelSets"},{"kind":"text","text":": [["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8IvorMIDI11MIDIChannelV","text":"MIDIChannel"},{"kind":"text","text":"]]"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/partchannelsets","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/partChannelSets","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every channel each part plays on, in the work’s order: the one each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of its instruments sounds on, which is the part’s own unless an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"assignment moves the instrument."}],"title":"partChannelSets"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WorkPerformance"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WorkPerformance"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"WorkPerformance","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A work as a MIDI player plays it: every part’s channel messages, each at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its time in the work, in the order they are sent."}]},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/Event":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/event","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Event","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"WorkPerformance.Event","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One channel message at its time in a work, exactly as the work has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it."}]},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/Equatable-Implementations":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/equatable-implementations","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Equatable-Implementations","title":"Equatable Implementations","type":"topic","abstract":[],"kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/ownedChannelSets":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ownedChannelSets"},{"kind":"text","text":": [["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8IvorMIDI11MIDIChannelV","text":"MIDIChannel"},{"kind":"text","text":"]]"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/ownedChannelSets","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The channels each part owns, in the work’s order: those of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/partChannelSets","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" that no earlier part plays on."}],"role":"symbol","title":"ownedChannelSets","url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/ownedchannelsets","type":"topic"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/channelOutputs(forPartOutputs:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"channelOutputs","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Output","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"forPartOutputs","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Output","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorExtern15WorkPerformanceV14channelOutputs07forPartF0SayxSgGSayxG_tlF6OutputL_xmfp"},{"text":"]) -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Output","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorExtern15WorkPerformanceV14channelOutputs07forPartF0SayxSgGSayxG_tlF6OutputL_xmfp"},{"text":"?]","kind":"text"}],"title":"channelOutputs(forPartOutputs:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns which output each channel plays through, given each part’s."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/channeloutputs(forpartoutputs:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/channelOutputs(forPartOutputs:)"},"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/duration":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/duration","kind":"symbol","title":"duration","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The time of the last event, or zero for a work with no events.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"duration","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8WallTimeV","text":"WallTime","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/duration","type":"topic"},"doc://IvorExtern/s8CopyableP":{"title":"Swift.Copyable","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s8CopyableP","type":"unresolvable"}}}